5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know the total cost before we book anything.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I am tired of losing two days just travelling.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a clear rule on who pays for what.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I need to know if I can sleep and wash properly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand why we feel alone together.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the travel is too long, we lose the trip.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
