35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The island house is 5,400 yen a head, but food is extra.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days. The train is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"All-in rates charge the same for everyone, which is fair.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The island house has one bathroom for everyone. That is bad.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Last year, we were together but felt alone. We need structure.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, one bathroom sounds terrible for five people.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train option saves us a full day of travel.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the valley inn is 17,000 yen with meals included.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I prefer the city if I can have my own room.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the city allows us to be together but also apart.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The city beds are 12,000 to 20,000 yen, plus meals.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The city trains run every few minutes. No waiting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The city is more expensive, but the cost is transparent.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The city room has a door. I can sleep better.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The city lets us choose when to meet. That is good.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am worried about the extra meal costs in the city.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am leaning towards the city for the travel time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I am leaning towards the city for the clear costs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I am leaning towards the city for the privacy.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am leaning towards the city for the balance.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
